From the archive's codex-rs directory, the companion can be rebuilt with the
recorded Cargo.lock and Rust 1.95.0 by setting CODEX_BWRAP_SOURCE_DIR to the
absolute path of vendor/bubblewrap, setting LIBCAP_STATIC=1, and running:

cargo build --locked -p codex-bwrap --bin bwrap --release

This exact source revision will remain available for as long as MCP Console
distributes wheels containing this companion.
